            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Rehoboamu bwe yatuuka e Yerusalemu, yaayeta abantu ab'omu kika kya Yuda n'ekya Benjamini. Abasaadha abalwani einho abaghera emitwalo eikumi n'omunaana (180,000), beesoloza okuja okulwanisa Abaisiraeli ab'omu kiketezo eky'oku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba wa Isiraeli, Rehoboamu oyo asobole okukiizaayo mu bwakyabazinga bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Katonda yaakoba omusaadha we Shemaia ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.11.1+2CH.11.2+2CH.11.3+2CH.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 11:1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koba Rehoboamu mutabane wa Solomoni era kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, okobe n'ab'omu kika kya Yuda, n'ekya Benjamini, era n'abantu boonaboona abandi, oti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Musengwa Katonda akoba ati mutaja kulumba baganda baimwe, Baisiraeli banaimwe. Mwireyo buli muntu mu maka ge, kuba ebyo ebibairegho, ninze nabireetagho.’ ” Agho baagondera ekiragiro kya Musengwa Katonda, bairayo ewaibwe nga Musengwa Katonda bwe yabalagira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yeroboamu yaazimba ekibuga Shekemu mu kiketezo kya Efuraimu eky'oku nsozi, yaaba omwo. Era yaava agho yaazimba ekibuga Penueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakoba mule ati: “Obwakyabazinga bwidha kabiri kwirira ab'endhu ya Daudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kasita abantu bano banaajanga e Yerusalemu okughaayo emisengo ye Musengwa Katonda mu isinzizo. Olwo omwoyo gwaibwe kabiri gukyukire eri musengwa waibwe Rehoboamu kyabazinga wa Isiraeli, nze bandhite, baire y'ali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale kyabazinga Yeroboamu oyo yaalowoolereza inho ku kintu ekyo, era yaamala yaakola ebifaananie eby'ente ento bibiri mu zaabu. Agho yaakoba abantu ati: “Mubairenga nga muja e Yerusalemu okumala ekiseera ekireeyi ekimala. Mubone eno, imwe Abaisiraeli, bano ni bakatonda baimwe abaabatoola mu Misiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaata ekifaananie eky'ente ento ekindi mu Betheli, n'ekindi yaakita mu Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo kyaleetera abantu okwonoona, kuba baajanga okusinza omusambwa ogwali mu Betheli, era baajanga n'okusinza gule ogwali eghala mu Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eghala mu Dani:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bangi ku bantu abo baali nga baba ghala inho n'ekibuga Dani. Aye nga baasalagho okuja eyo okusinza, baaloba kuja Yerusalemu ekyali okumpi nabo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu era yaazimba amasabo mu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, yaataagho bakabona ng'abatoola mu bantu abatali ba mu kika kya Levi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
